{"obsah":"<p><strong>22/7 – Day camp exhibition – Petrohrad</strong></p>\n\n<p>The Friday farewell for kids at the camps in Petrohrad is ridden every year by Martin Šimůnek, but he was called away by family commitments and it was up to Vlasta to stand in for him. What could be better than taking along the smallest rider from the club, Marty, to ride a show with his dad for participants of the same age or older?&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>The sun was scorching a bit, but after the exhibition we still held a small workshop for those interested, lending bikes to an estimated 40–50 kids, including competitions.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F07%2FA1F24974-9FD2-4678-927C-A1817FF4B2B2-scaled.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F07%2FA1F24974-9FD2-4678-927C-A1817FF4B2B2.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-211275\"/></a></figure>\n</figure>\n\n<p><strong>23/7 – Test camp and exhibition at Polevsko bike park – Polevsko near Česká Lípa</strong></p>\n\n<p>We needed to thoroughly test the Polevsko bike park for possible camps in 2023, and the Saturday coaching event with a Trial exhibition, to which Martin and Vlasta were invited, was the ideal chance to ride the whole park to the full. Club rider Petr Jeřicha used the spare seat in the car to train for the Enduro Series, and despite the bad forecast set off with Vlasta to meet Martin and host Michal Matys.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>Apart from a few morning drops, luckily it didn't rain until 3 pm, so we managed to coach a small group of bikers, ride 2 short exhibitions and do some photography. We went through the tricky parts of the local trails and the bike park's options and rode the local chairlift. For us, Polevsko is a nice family bike park with technique, jumps and a few small drops. Its 4 trails will soon be extended by an almost 8 km trail, but even in their current state, with multiple lines and hidden jumps, they'll keep every biker entertained.</p>\n\n<p>We look forward to next year and a possible Bikeskills camp or coaching.</p>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F07%2FPolevsko_bikeCamp_2022_PCH_07232022_003-1.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F07%2FPolevsko_bikeCamp_2022_PCH_07232022_003-1.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-211297\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F07%2FPolevsko_bikeCamp_2022_PCH_07232022_004-1.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F07%2FPolevsko_bikeCamp_2022_PCH_07232022_004-1.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-211293\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F07%2FPolevsko_bikeCamp_2022_PCH_07232022_005-1.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F07%2FPolevsko_bikeCamp_2022_PCH_07232022_005-1.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-211294\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F07%2FPolevsko_bi